menu "ARB Guard Configuration"

config ARB_GUARD
       bool "Enable ARB Guard (Anti ARB-fuse burn)"
       default n
       depends on SECURITY
       help
          Block all writes to /sys/kernel/dload/update_arb
          so the ARB (Anti-Rollback) fuse can never be burned
          by the boot HAL or malicious scripts, keeping the
          device recoverable over EDL 9008.
          If unsure, leave this n.

endmenu
